| red-63sp | 19.54 (-22.6 %) | 10.25 (-28.7 %) |
| p2 (63 + 2) | 22.64 (-10.3 %) | 12.39 (-13.8 %) |
| p6 (63 + 6) | 25.29 (+0.2 %) | 14.49 (+0.8 %) |

Both candidates were then taken through the full held-out validation (ignition: 792-case matrix,
