mechanism list so the reference is the parent itself, `results/flame_cmp_phi1.csv` and
`results/flame_cmp_lean5.csv`):

| mechanism | species / reactions | ignition mean / p95 / max | > 35 % | flame phi = 1, 300 K, 1 atm: mean / max | lean 5 atm phi = 0.7: C3H6 / C4H81 / C6H5CH3 |
